      "common:generalComment": [
        {
          "#text": "Phenolic resin is a synthetic polymer obtained by the reaction of phenol or substituted phenol with formaldehyde. It is processed into a thermosetting plastic and used in various applications due to its high mechanical strength, flame resistance, and low smoke production. The product flow information might detail the specifics of the resin's production route, quality adherence to standards, forms of availability (i.e., in pre-polymer or polymerized form), whether it is part of a production or consumption mix, and its distribution, 'to consumer' or 'at plant'.",
          "@xml:lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "#text": "酚醛树脂是通过苯酚或取代苯酚与甲醛反应获得的合成聚合物。它被加工成热固性塑料，并由于其高机械强度、阻燃性和低烟产生量而被用于各种应用。产品流信息可能详述树脂的生产路线、符合标准的质量、形态（即预聚合体或聚合形态）、是否为生产或消费混合物的一部分，以及它的分布情况，'对消费者'或'在工厂'.",
          "@xml:lang": "zh"
        }
